Introduce `u f B a₀ a`. Unfold `tOf`. Rewrite using `[mul_assoc, hmul, hinv]`. Establish `hT` using `congrArg (fun g : GA D (D.sp.Y 0) => Formalism.IndefR.Lev.finE (Yc D 0) (show GA D (Yc D 0) from g)) heq`. Simplify using `only [hmul, ht] at hT`.

Establish `hcong` using `GlobalTheory.T.row_level_integral_twist W hP hr u u' _ hκ (θ * c) θ' (Subring.mul_mem _ hθ hci) hθ' PP hPP (fun ei hei => by`. Establish `key` using `lattice_ratio_vector_of_scalar_factorisation (toEAf D ei) c θ θ' _ _ _ _ _ _ hc hT _ _ Γ (hm ei hei) (hm' ei hei)`. Establish `hκE : Formalism.IndefR.Lev.finE (Yc D 0) (show GA D (Yc D 0) from (tOf f' B' a₀' a' * k * (tOf f' B' a₀' a')⁻¹ : GA D (D.sp.Y 0))) = Formalism.IndefR.Lev.finE (Yc D 0) (show GA D (Yc D 0) from tOf f' B' a₀' a') * Formalism.IndefR.Lev.finE (Yc D 0) (show GA D (Yc D 0) from k) * (F …` using `((map_mul (Formalism.IndefR.Lev.finE (Yc D 0)) _ _).trans (congrArg₂ (· * ·) (map_mul (Formalism.IndefR.Lev.finE (Yc D 0)) _ _) (map_inv (Formalism.IndefR.Lev.finE (Yc D 0)) _)))`. Rewrite `hκE` using `[ht u' f' B' a₀' a']`. Rewrite `key` using `[← hκE]`.

